{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/941240-do-demons-age","id":941240,"title":"Do Demons Age?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-01T10:06:02-07:00","id":941240,"title":"Do Demons Age?","content":"After a demon possesses a mortal host, does said mortal age? I can't seem to find this info in the core DtF book, but I could be looking up the wrong info.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5128-synderryn","name":"Synderryn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T10:15:40-07:00","id":941247,"title":"","content":"I've always ruled that the host body ages, but doesn't really suffer the effects of old age. Just one day the host body just gives out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T11:48:54-07:00","id":941310,"title":"","content":"Thanks. Someone IRL I've gamed with told me they thought that as long as the demon had 1 point of faith, they didn't age, but they couldn't be sure on that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5128-synderryn","name":"Synderryn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T20:44:41-07:00","id":941652,"title":"","content":"Once demons possess a host the body does not age and is immune to disease. This information can be found in the player's guide, page 15. (This is assuming the demon never goes below 1 temporary Faith, at which point they would be rendered as helpless as a mortal, until they regained it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12205-xero_asura","name":"Xero_Asura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T21:17:49-07:00","id":941669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xero_Asura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/941240-do-demons-age?p=941652#post941652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once demons possess a host the body does not age and is immune to disease. This information can be found in the player's guide, page 15. (This is assuming the demon never goes below 1 temporary Faith, at which point they would be rendered as helpless as a mortal, until they regained it.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5128-synderryn","name":"Synderryn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}